{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/122289-farewell-and-thank-you-bob-hoskins","id":122289,"title":"Farewell and thank you, Bob Hoskins","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-30T06:07:37-07:00","id":122289,"title":"Farewell and thank you, Bob Hoskins","content":"Bob Hoskins, perhaps best known to most of us for playing Eddie Valiant in <b>Who Framed Roger Rabbit</b>, <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/news/ni57139860/?ref_=hm_nw_tp_t1\" target=\"_blank\">has died.</a> He was diagnosed with Parkinson's disease two years ago, yet he died of pneumonia, a disease I often hear peers in the medical community refer to with no irony as a sick, old person's best friend. I infer he made the choice to let it take him, which kind of breaks my heart, but I guess he didn't want to let the Parkinson's proceed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T06:34:04-07:00","id":122300,"title":"","content":"Damn. Another favorite from my childhood gone...<br /> <br /> Godspeed Bob.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sure, there's no way to canonically do it, but Exalted allows you to knee canon in the crotch and rifle through its pockets to take what you need while it whimpers on the ground. - mockery","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/374-nocte-ex-mortis","name":"Nocte ex Mortis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar374_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T09:11:39-07:00","id":122380,"title":"","content":"Now my childhood has died. I felt it fall out from my center.<br /> <br /> See you later, Bob. Keep doing what you love on the next run, and know we will miss you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T09:19:47-07:00","id":122390,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"http://stream1.gifsoup.com/view8/4659846/roger-is-crying-o.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T10:05:28-07:00","id":122430,"title":"","content":"Aww damn, I loved t