! For some reason, I always though he'd make a great Doctor Who...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>You never saw <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0102057/\" target=\"_blank\">Hook</a>?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T15:52:33-07:00","id":124076,"title":"","content":"I don't know how to feel about this. Because on the one hand, I think he was a good actor and I'm very sad that he died.<br /> <br /> On the other hand I thought he died like a decade ago so I'm getting some whiplash here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T20:09:02-07:00","id":124237,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/122289-farewell-and-thank-you-bob-hoskins?p=123939#post123939\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You never saw <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0102057/\" target=\"_blank\">Hook</a>?</div> </div> </div> </div>Hell, that WAS him as Smee, wasn't it? That movie was always one of my guilty pleasures...Hm, according to IMDB, he reprised the role in the Neverland tv series, and I must have seen him in Enemy at the Gates and Snow White and the Huntsman, but I don't recall him in those...must rewatch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-05T06:41:25-07:00","id":125762,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/122289-farewell-and-thank-you-bob-hoskins?p=124237#post124237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hell, that WAS him as Smee, wasn't it? That movie was always one of my guilty pleasures...Hm, according to IMDB, he reprised the role in the Neverland tv series, and I must have seen him in Enemy at the Gates and Snow White and the Huntsman, but I don't recall him in those...must rewatch.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, he's one of those actors that can adopt a role so well, you might not realize it's him in another movie.<br /> <br /> If anyone else remembers the movie <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0092035/?ref_=nv_sr_1\" target=\"_blank\">Sweet Liberty</a> with Alan Alda, Bob is in that one, too. Looks like Smee, but sounds like Eddie Valiant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T09:37:40-07:00","id":133900,"title":"","content":"I didn't go out of my way to watch him, but I thought he was a good actor. I liked him more funny parts like when he played Smee. He is one of those actors that for me I feel doesn't really have someone that the proverbial torch would go to in the next generation.<br /> <br /> I felt that for Harold Ramis dying recently too. He gave me some of my favorite comedies of all time. It sad to see anyone one die early(when they seem so vital even 69, or 71 for Hoskins, is early) but even more so the really great ones that give us so much joy.<br /> <br /> RIP Bob Hoskins and thank you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always forward.<br /> Don't ask why that came to mind or that I felt the need to post it.<br /> I see the incorporeally challenged.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/787-sorwen","name":"Sorwen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T10:09:14-07:00","id":133951,"title":"","content":"Rest in peace Bob. You will be missed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/481-rahsith","name":"rahsith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar481_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}